 class=\"mjx-c1D713 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Γ</mi><mo>⊢</mo><mi>ψ</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>. State the statement\nyou prove by induction, and say which principle of induction you\nuse.</li>\n</ol>\n</div>","file":"ch04-semantics-soundness-completeness/08-completeness.html"}